Well, you could stop it if you changed the code.  :-)  But what I think you're
seeing is the feature of nethack that has all items you start the game with
identified.  This does *not* mean that *all* items are identified, just the
ones you start with.  Believe me, this does *not* make the game any easier. 
Just play it for a while and see.

